---
layout: home.njk
permalink: /team/
pageKey: team
pagecss: pages
title: "Team — Agentic Builders"
description: "Meet the people behind Agentic Builders and learn how our AI agent, Abi, supports the team. Partners make investment decisions."
---
<main class="inv" id="main">
  <section class="inv-hero">
    <h1>{{ fund.team_page.title }}</h1>
    <p class="lead2">{{ fund.team_page.intro }}</p>
    <ul class="team" role="list">{% for person in fund.team %}{% if not person.agent %}<li class="rv"><span class="ph" aria-hidden="true">{{ person.name | first }}</span><h2>{{ person.name }}</h2><span class="role">{{ person.role }}</span><p>{{ person.line }}</p><a class="quiet" href="{{ person.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn <span class="sr-only">— {{ person.name }}</span>→</a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul>
  </section>
  <section id="ai">
    <h2 class="t rv">{{ fund.team_page.ai_heading }}</h2>
    {% for person in fund.team %}{% if person.agent %}<div class="ai-role rv"><h3>{{ person.name }}</h3><p>{{ person.line }}</p></div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </section>
  <section class="last">
    <h2 class="t rv">Contact us</h2>
    <p class="lead2 rv">Questions about the fund or our work with founders? Email us.</p>
    <div class="cta rv"><a class="pill pill-dark" href="mailto:{{ fund.fund.email }}">Contact us</a></div>
  </section>
</main>
